{"id":"687f6bb462487d36","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-identity-type-compat.md","title":"identity-type — 本书相等的历史拼写","display":"identity-type — 本书相等的历史拼写","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-identity-type-compat","aliases":["16-df-identity-type-compat","16-identity-type"],"display":"identity-type — 本书相等的历史拼写","depends_on":["[[16-df-identity-type]]"],"review_status":"source-rules-reconstructed","review_priority":"P2","review_note_id":"J07","review_date":"2026-10-16","source":"§11.4, pp. 680–681 (PDF 700–701)","review_scope":"Historical spelling of selected equality package","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-identity-type-compat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-identity-type-compat</span><span>16-identity-type</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"identity-type — 本书相等的历史拼写"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5c7f9132ab843c91\" href=\"?note=5c7f9132ab843c91\" title=\"16-df-identity-type\">16-df-identity-type</a></span></div>"},{"key":"review_status","html":"source-rules-reconstructed"},{"key":"review_priority","html":"P2"},{"key":"review_note_id","html":"J07"},{"key":"review_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"source","html":"§11.4, pp. 680–681 (PDF 700–701)"},{"key":"review_scope","html":"Historical spelling of selected equality package"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Kind}\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Kind}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash M,N:A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash M,N:A\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Eq}_A\">\\(\\mathsf{Eq}_A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_A\">\\(r_A\\)</span> 以及所选弱、强或很强规则包来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c7f9132ab843c91\" href=\"?note=5c7f9132ab843c91\" title=\"16-df-identity-type\">16-df-identity-type</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Id}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Id}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{refl}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}\">\\(\\mathrm{refl}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}\\)</span> 是本原子定义的历史拼写；上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{legacy}\">\\(\\mathrm{legacy}\\)</span> 只区分拼写，完整定义在下节。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Id}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_A(M,N)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Eq}_A(M,N),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{refl}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_A(M)\\coloneqq r_A(M).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Id}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_A(M,N)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Eq}_A(M,N),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{refl}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_A(M)\\coloneqq r_A(M).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>来源：§11.4，pp. 680–681（PDF 700–701）。别名仅替换拼写，不改变所选消去强度；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf E\">\\(\\mathsf E\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta/\\eta\">\\(\\beta/\\eta\\)</span> 与三种消去规则均在规范原子中明确列出。</li>\n<li>旧入口曾指向另加的 intensional <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 草稿；本轮已迁移为书中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Eq}\">\\(\\mathsf{Eq}\\)</span>，不能再把本入口作为独立 intensional identity type 的来源。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-identity-type","status":"resolved","id":"5c7f9132ab843c91","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-identity-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-identity-type","status":"resolved","id":"5c7f9132ab843c91","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Kind}$，$\\Gamma\\vdash M,N:A$。$\\mathsf{Eq}_A$、$r_A$ 以及所选弱、强或很强规则包来自 [[16-df-identity-type]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Kind}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash M,N:A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Eq}_A","display":false},{"tex":"r_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Id}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{refl}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{legacy}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Id}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_A(M,N)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Eq}_A(M,N),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{refl}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_A(M)\\coloneqq r_A(M).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf E","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta/\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Eq}","display":false}],"bytes":1451,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-261","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-identity-type-compat|identity-type — 本书相等的历史拼写]]"}],"outgoing":["5c7f9132ab843c91"]}